## Current

**Run Module 11 end-to-end**

Terminal 1 — simulator:

```powershell
cd D:\disk_E\Byclarityy\kroll_pharmacy_project
pip install -r requirements.txt
python apps/pharmacy_simulator/main.py
```

Terminal 2 — workflow (simulator running, main window visible):

```powershell
python apps/workflow_engine/main.py --workflow inbox_to_save
python apps/workflow_engine/main.py --workflow inbox_to_save --mode hybrid
python apps/workflow_engine/main.py --list-reviews
```

Or via automation controller:

```powershell
python apps/automation_controller/main.py --workflow inbox_to_save
```

On failure: check `database/workflow_audit.db`, `logs/workflow_audit.jsonl`, `screenshots/error_*.png`.

**Important:** Start the simulator **before** the workflow. Keep the **Kroll main window** focused (not Cursor/terminal). Automation only attaches to the simulator **process** (same PID as `win_main`).

**Fastest path:** `--mode hybrid` (skips Inbox UI; headless extract + search/record UI only).

